    "body": "Our (Firefox) implementation bug is filed to align our behavior with other browsers for the case where a radio input is inserted into a **_disconnected_** radio group. Previously, we would also run the steps to update the checkedness state, but other browsers don’t. And this PR bring the spec inline with what all browsers do currently.\r\n",
